<InfoPage title="Your shop. Your data." description="Privacy for the Mise product preview. Updated 15 November 2026."><h2>This site</h2><p>The landing site has no analytics or advertising trackers. It does not ask you to create an account, enter a phone number or submit business data.</p><h2>Your region choice</h2><p>We save your selected region in your browser’s local storage as mise.region. You can change it from the region menu or clear it by clearing this site’s browser data. If storage is unavailable, both regional pages still work.</p><h2>Location and hosting</h2><p>By default, the region router uses your browser’s timezone and language. If the site owner configures a country lookup service, your browser contacts that service to choose a regional page. This deployment does not configure one. GitHub Pages hosts this site and handles requests according to GitHub’s privacy policies.</p><h2>Links to other services</h2><p>WhatsApp, GitHub and Vercel links open services with their own privacy policies. Device downloads and connected accounts will be described when those features are available.</p><h2>The app</h2><p>The current app is a coming-soon screen. It does not store orders, customer details or payments. We’ll update this page before adding those features.</p></InfoPage>
